abstract: >-
  A free, browser-based planner and vendor-neutral templates (pre-migration audit
  worksheet, risk register, rule review worksheet, rollback plan, and go/no-go
  sign-off form) that help
  small and mid-sized healthcare organizations carry out firewall migrations
  using the Secure Migration and Operational Stability Framework.
keywords:
  - healthcare cybersecurity
  - firewall migration
  - network security
  - small and rural healthcare
  - change management
